window.products.push({"id":932071,"name":"Hiware 24-piece Good Stainless Steel Teaspoon, 6.7 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GFwoI2-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dine In Elegance With Hiware 24-Piece Good Stainless Steel Teaspoons Hiware stainless steel teaspoons are made to add elegance to any table setting to elevate your dining experience. Using a classic design, these spoons are suitable for everyday use along with all casual and formal events, parties, corporate events, and more. Made To Last The Test Of Time Made using high quality, heavy weight 18/8 stainless steel, our spoons are sturdy and can be comfortably held in your hands no matter what you’re eating. Each spoon is carefully weighted to enhance the dining experience while the elegant shine and classic design adds a luxurious touch to it making it perfect for all your needs. Thanks to the heavy duty construction, this spoon is perfect for high traffic establishments and catered events while still ensuring years of reliable use. Bright Mirror Finish With a classic yet fashion forward design with rounded edges along with bright mirror polish, these elegant teaspoons effortlessly uplift the visual appeal of your dinner table. Unlike the rest, these don’t tarnish even after hundreds of washes to make sure they look just as good event after months of use as the day you bought them. Attractive Rounded Handle Featuring an attractively rounded handle, this spoons adds sophistication to your tabletops, while ensuring a firm and comfortable. Use it with steak and potatoes, fresh fish and steamed vegetables, lasagna, pasta dishes cheese and so much more!  HIWARE is the definitive kitchenware brand with over 20 years of foodservice and hospitality industry experience. Reliable and trusted by professionals, our commercial lines of products, span from tabletops, restaurant kitchens supplies to utensils. We are now very proud to make our tools and gadgets available to any home cook and hope to give them the joy of using quality utensils loved by professionals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GFwoI2-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIWARE","source_asin":"B07YFFTYJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YFFTYJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YFFTYJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
