window.products.push({"id":932119,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner,Round Non-Stick Air Fryer Paper Liners,With 100 Pcs Disposable gloves, for Air Fryer, Microwave Oven, Frying Pan, Oil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lqyd+y+nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🍟Healthy And Reliable Material:(100pcssair Fryer Paper Liners Brown & 100pcs Disposable Gloves) Comes With Disposable Gloves For Easy Access Using Food Grade Parchment, It Is Waterproof, Oil-Proof, Non-Stick, 100% Healthy And With Nice Heat Resistant, Can Withstand Temperatures Up To 428 Degrees Fahrenheit. It Has No Effect On The Taste Of Food. 🍟Keep Clean: These Disposable Circular Paper Liners Effectively Isolate Grease Stains, Remove Food Debris From The Fryer, And Extend The Life Of Your Air Fryer. If You Hate Cleaning Your Air Fryer After Baking, You'Ll Love These Air Fryer Paper Liners.Which Is Convenient For You To Clean, Save Worry And Effort. 🍟Easy To Use:These Non-Stick Disposable Air Fryer Liners Are Designed With A Round Bowl Shape, Which Do Not Need To Tear, Fold, Cut, Nor Bend, And You Can Directly Put It In When You Are Ready To Cook. Its Heightened Edge 4.5cm Can Protect The Side Of Fryers And Prevent Food From Sticking To Them,To Them While Making It Easy To Remove Food. 🍟Multiple Uses: These Disposable Paper Liners Can Be Used In Air Fryers, The paper liners can be applied for baking, roasting, frying, or serving food, used for home baking, camping, BBQ, summer party, and so on, lightweight and practical. Non-stick baking paper suitable for air fryer, microwave, oven, steamer, cooker, etc; It is very convenient to meet the needs of daily home camping baking. 🍟Note: Please Put In The Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner And Food, And Then Turn On The Air Fryer, Do Not Put Only The Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner Without Food And Open The Air Fryer, It May Cause The Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner To Catch Fire , Please Note.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lqyd+y+nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HXGNLOMD","source_asin":"B09XQXD6S4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XQXD6S4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XQXD6S4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
