window.products.push({"id":932173,"name":"PHILOGOD Ceramic Incense Burner Holders for Sticks, Cone, Coil Incense, 3.15 Inch and 2 Ears Craftmanship Censer (Green-1-black line)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gxUOAxYKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Excellent Performance: incense burners vary in style, colors and size, but all features a place for catching ash and keep incense product in the holder burning safely. This product helps to give the support different kind of incense as well as give the support to the incense sticks to prevent it from falling and catch up fire. It also performs very well to collect the ash falling from the incense sticks, leave the surface clean. Material: The ceramic is fired by nature soil in furnace, 1300Degrees celsius for firing the porcelain incense burner. After high temperature firing, it can remove harmful substances in the product, the production also save energy and protect the environment. Multi: scene application All-purpose Suitable Scene include study room, living room, bedroom, sauna, yoga studio, mediation room, kitchen, temple etc. Easy Application: Simply place the incense burner holder on a leveled surface and then light your incense product prior put in the center of the holder. If you want to use incense stick, you can place some material into the burner to support incense sticks. Materials could be special incense powder, sand and rice etc. Lighting your incense sticks and place it to the center of the burner at 90 degree. Perfect decoration: Unique design and style handmade incense holder. It come with different tone of green and different print: black line, ice crack. The delicate design reflects the art of nature Chinese style. It could also used to decorate your house on various occasions, festivals and parties. It gives your house a beautiful look and with the ethnic designs of incense burners, you can also decorate your exterior as well as your inhouse-temples.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gxUOAxYKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHILOGOD","source_asin":"B07TPKZBT5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TPKZBT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TPKZBT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
