window.products.push({"id":932185,"name":"imagine dream believe Lotus Backflow Incense Burner Ceramic Incense Holder Waterfall | Beautiful Home Decor Yoga Craftwork Figurine, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a9Uyj-O9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Breathe in and relax. This handmade IDB Lotus Backflow Incense Holder has been specifically designed to create a relaxing and peaceful environment.Since early times, incense has been used across almost every level of civilization for a variety of different reasons. Ancient Greeks usedincense as an Aphrodisiac, buddhist monks as a meditative aid and churches around the world use incense during religious ceremonies.Incense is also used to reduce Anxiety & Tension. The calming effects of incense are well known by Monks and spiritual leaders. Certain incense aromas work to slow down the heart rate and soothe nerves. These calming effects help to relieve built up tension in the muscles, enabling incense to also be used as a muscle relaxer.Now is your chance to get a stunning incense holder. Handcrafted by a master potter into the shape of a hand holding a delicate lotus flower. INCENSE HOLDER Handmade for use with backflow incense cones, standard incense cones, tower incense cones and even incense sticks WATERFALL EFFECT If a back-flow cone is used, the concealed hole will allow the back flow smoke to cascade like a waterfall down this incense holder. A perfect way to enjoy your backflow waterfall cones. APPROX SIZES 6 7/8\" (6.89\"/175mm)Width 8 1/4\" (8.25\"/ 210mm)Height CLEANING A residue may be left once you have finished burning, this can be simply washed away with soap and water. Ensure you dry your burner fully to keep it in a safe condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a9Uyj-O9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"imagine dream believe","source_asin":"B08GWWM98F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GWWM98F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GWWM98F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
