window.products.push({"id":932384,"name":"ALORAIR Commercial Dehumidifier with Pump, Up to 180 PPD (Saturation), 85 PPD at AHAM, Memory Starting, 5 Years Warranty, LGR Dehumidifier for Flood R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":799.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HwzMc0vQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✔【Commercial Grade Dehumidifier】This commercial dehumidifier with high airflow of 210 CFM to maximize the drying performance, is capable of removing up to 180 pints of water from the air per day at saturation (90°F, 90%) and 85 PPD @ AHAM, a top choice for the drying and water damage restoration industry in large space up to 2,300 square feet. ✔【Compact Design for Crawl Space】This LGR dehumidifier Standing at just 22.8×13.7×17.3 inches (L×W×H), the space-saving design with 2 carrying handles on the top of the housing makes it easy to position in small confined areas, great for crawl spaces, tight basements, and other hard-to-reach areas. ✔【Dehumidifier with Pump for Easy Drainage】: This commercial dehumidifier with pump will automatically drain the condensate out for the low-hassle operation. Plus, the 19.6 ft long drain hose and 14.7 ft drain vertical height maximize the flexibility of installation. 【Plug-and-Go Operation】All you need to do is plug it in, turn it on, set the humidity. The AUTO ON/OFF and Memory Starting adds convenience. The auto-restart on power failure and Auto defrost features allow less supervision. See the GPP number on the display board at a glance. ✔【5 Years Warranty】: Safety tested our Storm LGR Extreme dehumidifier is fully compliant with the electrical safety ETL. Every AlorAir dehumidifier comes with a 5-year warranty with a professional customer support team ready to assist at any time. Please feel free to contact us; you deserve the best after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HwzMc0vQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALORAIR","source_asin":"B07PWKPSBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PWKPSBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PWKPSBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":932385,"name":"Ello Linden 16oz Ceramic Coffee Mug (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418NxPL1DbL._AC_.jpg","description":"Drink directly from ceramic on-the-go with Ello Linden ceramic travel mug. The 16-ounce travel mug features a real wood base and a unique textured body, so you can drink your morning Joe in style. The friction fit slider lid resists splashing and doesn’t require threading. Linden's comfortable carry handle makes it ideal for on-the-go use. Ceramic doesn’t leach or hold odor, making Linden the perfect travel mug for on-the-go coffee, tea, matcha, or whatever gets your day started out right. Hand wash tumbler, lid is dishwasher safe. Do not microwave or freeze.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418NxPL1DbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ello","source_asin":"B07PP985TP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PP985TP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PP985TP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":932386,"name":"Paper Towel Holder Stainless Steel, DEROFIT Self Adhesive or Drilling Wall Mounted Paper Towels Bar for Kitchen Laundry Under Cabinet Desk RV Camper…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EqJ+ZBjmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUS 304 STAINLESS STEEL: Constructed of tough stainless steel, this paper towel is strong enough and not easily deformed,waterproof and rustproof. Except for good load-bearing, it also matches the rest of the stainless steel appliances in your room. VERTICALLY & HORIZONTALLY HOLDER: You can attach this all-metal paper towel holder horizontally or vertically for benefits of both convenience and space saving . Mounted in different positions with stylish and clean look. PASTE & DRILLING INSTALLATION: With super strong self-adhesive and screws, you can either stick it on the smooth wall surface after peeling off film of adhesive pad or drill the hole on any surface to install with screw for stronger stability. PLACED EVERYWHERE: RV must have! This paper towel holder can be attached to the periphery of or under the cabinet door, flat and tough wall surface, bathroom, laundry, restroom wall, used to place towels, paper towel roll, plastic wrap, utensils and anything that can be hung. EASY DISASSEMBLE: Unlike other paper towel holders mounted by 3M self-adhesive stickers, ours can be removed easily by heating the viscose with a blower, then peeling the adhesive off. NO terrible adhesion strips left which ruin your wall. Notes: Each item enjoys 12-month warranty! Backup adhesive stickers or new replacement will be arranged once we receive your messages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EqJ+ZBjmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEROFIT","source_asin":"B09HKDJFFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HKDJFFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HKDJFFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":932387,"name":"ARTCANVAS The Montagne Sainte-Victoire 1887 Canvas Art Print by Paul Cezanne - 12\" x 8\" (0.75\" Deep)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gnYGHiiNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[HANDCRAFTED IN THE U.S.A.] By the #1-Rated Canvas Brand on Amazon with exceptional vibrant colors and detail. [WHY ARTCANVAS] Premium Artist Grade Canvas / American Pine frame / Genuine Epson UltraChrome UV-Resistant Inks / Galvanized Staples / Lifetime Warranty [WHAT'S IN THE BOX] Ready-To-Hang Canvas + Free Hanging Kit + Installation Instructions + Care Guide [SAFE & SECURE SHIPPING] Your canvas' safety matters: packaged into sturdy boxes with foam corner protectors. [FAST DELIVERY] ORDERS SHIP OUT WITHIN 1 BUSINESS DAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gnYGHiiNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTCANVAS","source_asin":"B07DHT1MGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DHT1MGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DHT1MGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":932388,"name":"Joyce Chen Classic 14-Inch Carbon Steel Flat Bottom 4-Piece Wok Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iBAU8CZfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Part of the Classic Carbon Steel Series by Joyce Chen, the 14\" Flat Bottom Wok Set, Includes; Wok, Dome Lid, 12\" Bamboo Spatula, and recipe booklet. The Flat Bottom Wok is a heavy weight at 1.8 mm of carbon steel. It is made for use on gas or electric burners and the pan's heavy weight carbon steel body is designed for rapid, even heating and cooling ¿ a must for any stir-fry. Its generous size will enable you to make delicious Asian meals for your entire family. Once seasoned, these heavy weight carbon steel pans will render superior cooking performance for life. This pan is perfect for creating such authentic Asian-style recipes as curried shrimp with lemon rice and Szechwan beef stir-fry. This pan features Blonde wood grip and helper handles. The flat bottom sits securely on stove tops and two handles make it easy to use. These wood handles are designed to stay cool on the stovetop, so you can easily remove the pan from the burner without using potholders. Joyce Chen's slogan \"Eastern Cookware for the Western Kitchen,\" reflects her focus on providing high-quality, versatile tools and products that have Asian flair, but can be used in a western kitchen. Today, Joyce Chen Products come from all over the Pacific Rim to bring the best of Asia to you. Joyce Chen opened her first restaurant in Cambridge, Massachusetts in 1958. The restaurant flourished, and in 1973 a larger Cambridge restaurant was opened. Chen also began writing Chinese cookbooks and in the 1970s began hosting a cooking show on public television. She found that the selection and quality of Chinese cookware in America didn't live up to her high standards¿ so she developed her own.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iBAU8CZfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYCE CHEN","source_asin":"B0009S5NZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009S5NZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009S5NZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
