window.products.push({"id":932434,"name":"HayWHNKN Handheld Induction Sealer 20mm -100mm Induction Bottle Cap Sealer Electromagnetic Induction Aluminum Foil Sealing Machine Heat Sealing Machin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x4xBJgNBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Principle】Induction sealing machine is a kind of non-contact sealing machine, using electromagnetic induction principle to induct heating the nonmetallic bottle. 【Operation】Put the bottle with sensing film (aluminum foil side up) exactly under the inductive shell cover. Press the button on the top of the inductive shell cover, then the sealing time will count down. There will be sound reminders at the beginning and in the end. When the time comes to zero and show the count number again, then the sealing has finished. 【Functions】 0.8KW-1.2KW power(adjustable) can be adapted to different bottle mouth sizes. It also has counting function, automatic overheating, over-voltage and over-current protection functions. 【Digital Display】 Setup the sealing time and output power according to different sizes of bottle caps.Visible production volume indication,much more convenience for small and medium workloads. 【Widely use】This Induction Sealer is widely used for the fields of chemical industry, food, beverage, greased products, lubricating oil, antifreeze fluid, etc.Applied to the sealing of non-metallic containers such as plastic bottles and glass bottles, like ABS, PE(HDPE, LDPE), PET, PP, PS, PVC.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x4xBJgNBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HayWHNKN","source_asin":"B08GK7ZD8N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GK7ZD8N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GK7ZD8N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
