window.products.push({"id":932526,"name":"ObboMed HR-7690B New & Handy AIR Valve, Heavy Duty Extra Long and Wide Inflatable Bed Wedge Pillow with Velour Surface Finish for Sleeping Travel Trip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21jZ82AO9cL._AC_.jpg","description":"Advanced double-layered air valve for easy inflation and deflation - fill the air through the upper valve, and release the air by opening the lower valve; no worries of losing air while inflating the wedge and no frustration for difficult deflation. Versatile design to support and relieve stress on your back, shoulders and legs while lying down or sitting. The gradual incline and horizontal indention help to prevent you from sliding down while resting against the pillow. And the velour surface provides a comfortable touch which can be easily cleaned by wiping the wedge with a damp cloth. Extra-large size of the bed wedge makes you sleep better by keeping your shoulders from falling down from the wedge, allowing your shoulders to fully relax while asleep. It is also suitable for very tall people who prefer to sleep with the torso inclined and for those who are petite and would like to sleep on top of the wedge. Item Weight: 1.33 kg / 2.93 lbs. You can either use this bed wedge as a pillow while lying in bed to reduce symptoms of acid reflux as the wedge helps to raise your head higher than your stomach. You can also use it to raise your legs to increase blood circulation and reduce lower body swelling. Or, you can put it against your back when sitting, which can help to keep your posture correct. 180 days Warranty for any defects in materials and workmanship starting from the date you receive our product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21jZ82AO9cL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OBBO MED","source_asin":"B07KR84K8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KR84K8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KR84K8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
