window.products.push({"id":932673,"name":"Norjews Scratch Off Map of The World, Detailed World Map Poster with Capitals, States, Cities, Personalised Travel Map Tracks Your Adventures, Bonus S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81akcMxTg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The adventure doesn't have to stop when you come back home. Plan new explorations, relive your adventures and share your experiences with the help of your new scratch off travel map, in the comfort of your living room! Simply Scratch Off The Spots You’ve Visited Wherever you go, scratch off the gold layer to reveal a world of colour underneath. Don't forget about the continents too! Just give them a scratch at the bottom of the world map. Beautiful art piece for your wall Brighten up your room by putting your maps up on display - they look charming as they come but especially nice framed. Our travel size maps are a handy size - just right for your bedroom or office, even on a fridge door. The complete Accessories Kit Guitar scratcher is light and soft, helping you to scratch with ease and precision.  Mini magnifying glass enlarges 5 times, to assist with smaller details or for the visually impaired. It's super cute too! The perfect gift for your family and friends Scratch off your travels with the beautiful world map package from Upala! Just right for the traveller in your family or that friend's birthday.  Our scratchable travel map is cased in an elegant and sturdy gift tube. Wrap it if you like but it looks great as it comes. Product Dimensions: Scratch Off Map - 55cm x 42cm  Gift tube - 43cm x 4cm Package List: 1 x Scratch Off Map 1 x Gift tube 1 x Guitar scratcher 1 x Mini magnifying glass Our Promise If you're not happy with the item, we'll provide replace or refund, just feel free to contact us, we'll spare no efforts to provide the best service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81akcMxTg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BESWORLDS","source_asin":"B076K21H88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076K21H88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076K21H88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":932674,"name":"MSTK Tea Infuser Tumbler – Leakproof Double Wall Glass Tea Bottle with Strainer for Loose Leaf Tea and Fruit Infused Water - BPA Free Portable Travel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wn7FO6sXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"‘MSTK’ WHERE HEALTH AND HAPPINESS GO HAND IN HAND. WHY THE ‘MSTK’ GLASS TEA MUG? Because by paying attention to the fine details we can bring you a product that is finished to perfection and answers everything you need on your wish list of important features for your portable tea maker. IF YOU: * Want to maintain a healthy lifestyle * Ensure you are always hydrated and detox your body * Are working on losing weight * Enjoy drinking your favorite drink on the go * Are concerned about the environment THEN THIS IS THE INFUSER FOR YOU. KEEP HYDRATED IN STYLE Never drink your favorite drink from a dubious plastic bottle with “who knows what” harmful materials when you can drink in style from your elegantly decorated double-walled borosilicate glass travel mug. All ‘MSTK’ products are reusable, 100% BPA and lead-free. We believe in keeping our planet healthy, one less plastic bottle at a time. REASONS TO KEEP HEALTHY WITH THE ‘MSTK’ TEA TUMBLER: * The insulation layer between the two layers of glass prevents the outer glass from ever getting hot so there’s no condensation. The drink remains hotter or colder for longer. * No rust and no odor. * Leak-proof * 100% safe for all drinks. * Versatile - use to drink your favorite green, black or herbal tea as well as fruit-infused water or coffee hot or cold. Use fresh leaves or a ready-made tea bag whichever is most convenient. * Easy cleaning - open both ends for hassle-free and thorough cleaning especially if you use our time-limited bonus brush. * Versatile: it can be used for green, black, white, matcha/yerba tea leaves as well as herbs and fruit infused water. * Safety - the flat lids provide stability, even if you place the tumbler upside down. * It looks great! * It’s the perfect gift. GRAB YOUR ‘MSTK’ LOOSE LEAF STRAINER BOTLLE TODAY BY ADDING IT TO CART!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wn7FO6sXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MSTK","source_asin":"B07NWWLBGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NWWLBGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NWWLBGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
