window.products.push({"id":932891,"name":"Evo Glass Non-Aerosol Oil Sprayer Bottle for Cooking Oils (2-Pack, 6oz, Red) Bundle (2 Items)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-xZslN2fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Evo Glass Non-Aerosol Oil Sprayer Bottle, the world’s first non-aerosol trigger sprayer with a unique fan-shaped spray, easily dispenses cooking oil without harmful additives, propellants, or chemicals. Its 6-ounce capacity keeps the most used healthy cooking oil ready where needed, in the kitchen and at the grill! Perfect for All Cooking Oils Perfect for EVOO (extra virgin olive oil), canola oil, avocado oil, grapeseed oil, even infused oils with herbs and spices. It is great for balsamic vinegar, lime juice, and cooking wine too. Makes preparing healthy meals and practicing portion control easier! Evo allows complete control over calories, nutrition, and food purity. Uses Less Oil Every pull of the trigger delivers precise 1.35-ml in a unique fan pattern that covers more cooking surfaces with less oil. The trigger offers a natural ergonomic feel and a secure grip. Usage This sprayer bottle is helpful where food is being prepared, cooked, and served, even grill side for an easy outdoor lifestyle. It can be used for coating vegetables for roasting or broiling, flavor fillets for baking or steak for grilling, finish foods before serving, and apply salad dressing. Easy to Use It is easier to use than a traditional oil mister. No pumping, priming, or messy, clogged oil dispensers! Simply fill and firmly pull the trigger for consistent, even coverage. Made of Glass Made from glass, Evo is BPA, Latex, DEHP free, food-safe, durable, and recyclable. Economical and Easy to Store It is more economical than aerosol cooking spray and easy to store in the fridge. It can be dish-washed and it can be hand washed in warm, soapy water. Bundle Includes: 2 x Evo Glass Non-Aerosol Oil Sprayer Bottle for Cooking Oils (6oz, Red) 2 x Evo Glass Non-Aerosol Oil Sprayer Bottle for Cooking Oils (6oz, Red)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-xZslN2fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evo Oil Sprayer","source_asin":"B098BKHTR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-932891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098BKHTR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098BKHTR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
